# Flow Chart Layout Convention

When creating or editing MAX-LIT flow charts (HTML, SVG, Mermaid, or markdown diagrams):

- **Top of page:** **HOMEPAGE** (`/`)
- **Bottom of page:** **Checkout / expired access** (`/checkout10`)

The main spine runs top → bottom. Branch paths and side notes attach left/right of the spine; do not place Homepage anywhere except the top or ChatBox Time Expired anywhere except the bottom.
